      "result_summary": "Namespace-only and opaque-schema control produced exactly the same 12 predictions. The semantic namespace therefore supplied no measurable zero-shot benefit in this run while adding about 12 prompt tokens. The short group grammar did not preserve the full dictionary's semantic…",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/yurei-so/research/blob/main/experiments/voxel-guidance/docs/labnotes/voxel-guidance-005-semantic-namespace-ablation.md"
